    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;16.09</strong> Summary of the main features of familial adenomatous polyposis</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Arends MJ and Frayling IM",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 467.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"623\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; mso-background-themecolor: text2; mso-background-themetint: 102; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Syndrome characteristics</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Syndrome MIM number(s)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">175100</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Associated malignant tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Colorectal cancer, duodenal&nbsp;/ small intestinal cancer, gastric cancer, desmoid tumour/fibromatosis, hepatoblastoma, thyroid cancer, biliary tree cancer, pancreas cancer, CNS cancer including medulloblastoma, adrenocortical cancer</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Colorectal adenoma, duodenal&nbsp;/ small intestinal adenoma, gastric adenoma, gastric fundic gland polyp, adrenocortical adenoma, osteoma, odontoma, epidermoid cyst</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autosomal dominant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>APC</em> (5q22.2)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 247.55pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"330\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">WNT pathway: APC is a regulator of the WNT signalling pathway that acts as a key scaffold protein binding critical components (including AXIN2 and phosphorylating enzymes) that tag (by phosphorylation and subsequently ubiquitination) the WNT effector protein &beta;-catenin for proteasomal destruction.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
